{"file": "穿越六零之我在山洞闷声发家-第2集.mp4", "ep": 2, "duration": 165.8, "segments": [{"start": 6.1, "end": 7.1, "text": "你们知道这五年"}, {"start": 7.1, "end": 8.1, "text": "我是怎么过的吗"}, {"start": 8.1, "end": 9.1, "text": "这五年"}, {"start": 9.1, "end": 10.1, "text": "我是怎么过吗"}, {"start": 11.1, "end": 12.1, "text": "老子睡柴房五年"}, {"start": 13.1, "end": 14.1, "text": "冬天灌风"}, {"start": 14.1, "end": 15.1, "text": "夏天漏雨"}, {"start": 15.1, "end": 17.1, "text": "现在我清清一拆就倒了"}, {"start": 18.23, "end": 19.23, "text": "他们住正房"}, {"start": 19.23, "end": 20.23, "text": "我吃圣饭"}, {"start": 20.23, "end": 21.23, "text": "舔干净的碗"}, {"start": 21.23, "end": 22.23, "text": "昨天我饿急了"}, {"start": 22.23, "end": 24.23, "text": "偷喝了几口小米粥"}, {"start": 24.23, "end": 25.23, "text": "就被打了一顿"}, {"start": 25.23, "end": 26.23, "text": "关进柴房"}, {"start": 26.23, "end": 29.09, "text": "这是昨天打的"}, {"start": 30.09, "end": 31.09, "text": "柴房里"}, {"start": 31.09, "end": 32.09, "text": "还有我恶婚后"}, {"start": 32.09, "end": 35.65, "text": "撞出的伤"}, {"start": 35.65, "end": 36.65, "text": "秦老孙"}, {"start": 36.65, "end": 37.65, "text": "刘昭帝"}, {"start": 37.65, "end": 38.65, "text": "秦天说的"}, {"start": 38.65, "end": 39.65, "text": "是真的"}, {"start": 41.77, "end": 42.77, "text": "他血口喷人"}, {"start": 42.77, "end": 44.76, "text": "是不是真的"}, {"start": 44.76, "end": 46.76, "text": "去柴房看看就知道"}, {"start": 46.76, "end": 47.79, "text": "也可以问问"}, {"start": 47.79, "end": 48.79, "text": "各位书博审思"}, {"start": 48.79, "end": 49.79, "text": "我这些年过的是"}, {"start": 49.79, "end": 50.79, "text": "什么日子"}, {"start": 50.79, "end": 52.53, "text": "老孙啊"}, {"start": 52.53, "end": 53.53, "text": "孩子大了"}, {"start": 54.53, "end": 55.53, "text": "这么对待"}, {"start": 55.53, "end": 56.53, "text": "确实不妥"}, {"start": 56.53, "end": 57.53, "text": "三爷爷"}, {"start": 57.53, "end": 58.53, "text": "我不求别的"}, {"start": 59.53, "end": 60.53, "text": "今天请几位"}, {"start": 60.53, "end": 61.53, "text": "长辈做见证"}, {"start": 61.53, "end": 62.53, "text": "我秦天"}, {"start": 62.53, "end": 63.53, "text": "要跟秦老孙"}, {"start": 63.53, "end": 64.53, "text": "刘昭帝断亲"}, {"start": 65.53, "end": 66.53, "text": "从此"}, {"start": 66.53, "end": 67.59, "text": "各过各的"}, {"start": 67.59, "end": 69.59, "text": "生死无关"}, {"start": 69.59, "end": 70.82, "text": "你想的没"}, {"start": 70.82, "end": 71.82, "text": "这家里的东西"}, {"start": 71.82, "end": 72.82, "text": "我什么都不要"}, {"start": 72.82, "end": 74.9, "text": "一根线"}, {"start": 74.9, "end": 75.9, "text": "一粒米"}, {"start": 75.9, "end": 76.9, "text": "我都不要"}, {"start": 78.13, "end": 79.13, "text": "只要断亲文书"}, {"start": 79.13, "end": 80.13, "text": "白纸黑字"}, {"start": 80.13, "end": 81.13, "text": "按手印"}, {"start": 82.16, "end": 83.16, "text": "秦天什么都不要"}, {"start": 84.16, "end": 85.16, "text": "只要粒文书"}, {"start": 85.16, "end": 86.16, "text": "脱离关系"}, {"start": 86.16, "end": 87.16, "text": "我看就这么办"}, {"start": 87.16, "end": 88.16, "text": "断"}, {"start": 88.16, "end": 89.16, "text": "进屋写文书"}, {"start": 89.16, "end": 90.16, "text": "按手印"}, {"start": 90.16, "end": 91.26, "text": "写清楚了"}, {"start": 91.26, "end": 93.26, "text": "秦天不要秦家"}, {"start": 93.26, "end": 94.26, "text": "一针一线"}, {"start": 94.26, "end": 95.26, "text": "跟秦老孙"}, {"start": 95.26, "end": 96.26, "text": "刘昭帝断亲"}, {"start": 97.26, "end": 98.26, "text": "按下手印"}, {"start": 98.26, "end": 99.26, "text": "谁都不许反悔"}, {"start": 100.32, "end": 101.32, "text": "乡亲们都看着"}, {"start": 101.32, "end": 102.32, "text": "我和三哥作证"}, {"start": 102.32, "end": 103.32, "text": "我不反悔"}, {"start": 107.46, "end": 108.46, "text": "除了这个门"}, {"start": 108.46, "end": 109.46, "text": "别指望秦家管你"}, {"start": 109.46, "end": 110.46, "text": "正合我意"}, {"start": 110.46, "end": 131.81, "text": "这大晚上的"}, {"start": 131.81, "end": 132.81, "text": "你去哪儿啊"}, {"start": 133.81, "end": 134.81, "text": "山脚下有个"}, {"start": 134.81, "end": 135.81, "text": "费手灵人山洞"}, {"start": 135.81, "end": 136.81, "text": "我先住那儿"}, {"start": 136.81, "end": 137.81, "text": "那地方又潮又偏"}, {"start": 137.81, "end": 138.81, "text": "还有野兽啊"}, {"start": 139.97, "end": 140.97, "text": "这孩子"}, {"start": 140.97, "end": 141.97, "text": "是心寒透了"}, {"start": 141.97, "end": 142.97, "text": "明天让民兵"}, {"start": 142.97, "end": 143.97, "text": "路过时看看吧"}, {"start": 144.97, "end": 145.97, "text": "有本事你就死在外边"}, {"start": 145.97, "end": 146.97, "text": "永远别回来"}, {"start": 148.86, "end": 149.86, "text": "饿"}, {"start": 149.86, "end": 150.9, "text": "还是饿"}, {"start": 150.9, "end": 151.9, "text": "可命运握在"}, {"start": 151.9, "end": 152.9, "text": "别人手里的窒息感"}, {"start": 152.9, "end": 153.9, "text": "没了"}, {"start": 153.9, "end": 155.15, "text": "山洞很远"}, {"start": 155.15, "end": 156.15, "text": "很破"}, {"start": 156.15, "end": 157.15, "text": "可能有野兽"}, {"start": 157.15, "end": 158.15, "text": "可那又怎样"}, {"start": 159.15, "end": 160.15, "text": "那是我自己的地方"}, {"start": 161.15, "end": 162.15, "text": "从此天高海阔"}, {"start": 163.15, "end": 164.15, "text": "老秦家"}]}